<title>SINGAPORE: Inter-Roller rights issue over-subscribe.</title>
<headline>Inter-Roller rights issue over-subscribe.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Material handling company Inter-Roller Engineering Ltd said on Wednesday 18.2 million shares, representing 106.86 percent of its renounceable right issue were received at the close of the rights issue.</p>
<p>In October, Inter-Roller had proposed a one for two bonus issue of shares and renounceable rights issue.</p>
<p>The company said about 16.77 or 98.34 percent of the issue were accepted.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703083)</p>
</text>
